  "description": "Whether you're cruising the streets or ripping up your local pump track, the Steel Reserve 1.2 delivers without compromise. The endurance and capability of Marzocchi's DJ3 fork compliments two individually sized, full chromoly frame options with internal headset and Euro BB. The SR 1.2 WANTS to be jumped. Consider yourself warned.\nFull chromoly frame w/ internal headtube and euro BB shell\n21.8\" TT (short), 22.5\" TT (long)\nMarzocchi DJ3 100 travel fork\nHaro 3-pc 8 spline cranks w/ sealed BB\nHaro 25t alloy chainring w/ 12t rear cog\nWellgo alloy platform pedals w/ replaceable pedals\nHaro chromoly riser bar & alloy front load stem\nHaro counterfit grips\nPivit alloy disc singlespeed cassette 36h\nWeinmann K-Max Pro double wall rims\nKenda K-Rad 26 x 2.3\" tires\nTektro Auriga hydraulic disc brake",
